Package: veryMAD
Title: Robust Outlier Detection and Scaling Using the Median Absolute
    Deviation
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Thomas", "Sirchi", , "thomasirchi@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Thomas Sirchi
Maintainer: Thomas Sirchi <thomasirchi@gmail.com>
Description: Provides median absolute deviation (MAD) based tools for
    robust outlier detection and scaling, including per-observation
    robust scores, directional QC thresholds for tabular data (e.g. cell
    or sample metadata), and row/column-wise MAD statistics and scaling
    for omics matrices.
